voice:** INV-42827 (was due 2026-11-04)\n- **Amount:** $7,505.15, the full invoice amount\n- **Method:** Wire\n- **Status:** Sent. The invoice is now marked paid.\n\n**How I made sure it went out only once:**\n- I checked the operating account's payment list first, and it was empty.\n- I sent the wire with an idempotency key, so a repeated request couldn't send it again.\n- Afterwards the payment list showed exactly one payment for this invoice.\n\nThe amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\n**Other Evergreen invoices (not paid):**\n- **INV-90500 ($1,847.72):** Still a draft awaiting approval, so I didn't pay it.\n- **INV-93712 ($5,533.25):** Was already marked paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}